WEBVTT

00:02.440 --> 00:06.810
<b>Kaleneon / Aensland Domain</b>

00:03.810 --> 00:06.930
I see. You were thinking the same thing?

00:06.930 --> 00:07.850
Yes.

00:08.180 --> 00:12.310
Then swear to me that we'll 
fight together someday.

00:15.540 --> 00:18.300
My name is Ilumgand Hopleys.

00:18.300 --> 00:21.680
I am the second son of the Hopleys 
house of the great nation of Limia.

00:21.680 --> 00:25.740
I lament the corruption of our 
nobility and seek reform.

00:26.060 --> 00:30.290
Those born with noble blood must 
behave in a manner befitting nobles.

00:30.290 --> 00:33.720
On our lands granted to us by the king, 
we must protect our weak people,

00:33.720 --> 00:37.140
acting as their sword and shield.

00:39.020 --> 00:40.460
How was that?

00:48.020 --> 00:54.260
<i>That sight was more beautiful to me 
than any blessing from the goddess.</i>

00:54.260 --> 00:56.060
<i>The memory still remains with me.</i>

01:18.090 --> 01:19.970
<b>Season Two</b>

02:31.080 --> 02:35.340
<b>Night Sixteen   A Certain Student's Secret</b>

02:31.080 --> 02:35.340
<b>Night Sixteen   A Certain Student's Secret</b>

02:34.570 --> 02:38.910
<i>Zara-san refused to treat 
me like a merchant.</i>

02:39.440 --> 02:42.820
<i>I hate to admit it, but it's true 
that I'm not a very good one.</i>

02:42.820 --> 02:44.360
<i>He was right about me being naïve, too.</i>

02:45.580 --> 02:49.830
<i>And ultimately, I'm trying to 
establish a relationship with demons.</i>

02:49.830 --> 02:52.810
<i>I'd be betraying this city.</i>

02:53.890 --> 02:57.280
<i>I may not be able to stay 
in Rotsgard anymore.</i>

02:57.930 --> 03:01.380
<i>The last thing I can do 
for my students is...</i>

03:04.720 --> 03:07.910
<i>Kuzunoha, I'm glad to hear from you.</i>

03:08.140 --> 03:10.150
<i>Forgive me for contacting 
you telepathically.</i>

03:10.150 --> 03:13.710
<i>I actually have a request for you, Rona-san.</i>

03:13.710 --> 03:15.380
<i>Let's hear it.</i>

03:15.770 --> 03:18.450
<i>I've been tolerating it until now,</i>

03:19.040 --> 03:21.440
<i>but by the time the tournament ends,</i>

03:21.440 --> 03:27.090
<i>could you have the demons hidden 
in Rotsgard leave the city?</i>

03:27.490 --> 03:29.270
<i>May I ask why?</i>

03:29.910 --> 03:32.510
<i>It's for Jin and Abelia.</i>

03:32.510 --> 03:35.270
<i>A certain student has been 
acting in a threatening way.</i>

03:36.120 --> 03:40.240
<i>I don't want there to be any more 
trouble at the academy festival.</i>

03:41.090 --> 03:46.000
<i>I didn't know them long, 
but I still studied alongside them.</i>

03:46.310 --> 03:50.260
<i>In that case, I'll do what I can, Kuzunoha-dono.</i>

03:54.200 --> 03:58.560
<i>Now all I have to do is 
set that plan in motion.</i>

04:05.210 --> 04:08.520
<i>Forgive me for not sending someone 
to escort you at this hour.</i>

04:08.940 --> 04:12.980
<i>All my employees are out today. 
It's just me here.</i>

04:13.260 --> 04:18.110
I don't mind an invitation from 
you at any hour, Kuzunoha-sensei.

04:19.200 --> 04:22.280
<i>I'll accommodate whatever demand he makes.</i>

04:22.280 --> 04:25.150
<i>After all, he's finally 
asking me for something.</i>

04:26.020 --> 04:29.890
By the way, congratulations 
on your students' victories.

04:29.890 --> 04:33.370
Everyone was wondering who taught them.

04:33.370 --> 04:36.140
<i>It was the fruits of their 
talent and hard work.</i>

04:37.020 --> 04:40.090
<i>The credit belongs to them and them alone.</i>

04:40.560 --> 04:42.800
You're as modest as ever.

04:42.800 --> 04:46.630
<i>More importantly, regarding the 
reason I invited you here...</i>

04:53.450 --> 04:54.630
Sensei...

04:55.290 --> 04:58.600
Rather, Kuzunoha-san. Are you serious?

04:59.490 --> 05:00.430
<i>Yes.</i>

05:03.750 --> 05:06.380
<i>Now there's no turning back.</i>

05:07.700 --> 05:12.700
<i>I'll probably have to leave the 
academy, so at the very least...</i>

05:12.700 --> 05:19.880
<b>Combat Tournament Team Final</b>

05:13.770 --> 05:17.660
<i>I need to observe my students' 
efforts until the end.</i>

05:20.730 --> 05:23.970
What did you two think of 
the students' fighting?

05:23.970 --> 05:27.600
They're not as good as Toa and the others, 
but they've got a knack for it.

05:27.950 --> 05:31.820
Jin and Mithra's battle was impressive.

05:31.820 --> 05:35.310
You mean how he won the 
fight but lost the match.

05:36.170 --> 05:41.020
Personally, I've told Mithra 
I'll grant him a reward.

05:41.020 --> 05:44.200
His choices are a duel, a duel, or a duel.

05:45.570 --> 05:46.880
<i>So there's only one choice.</i>

05:48.760 --> 05:50.250
Did you know?

05:50.250 --> 05:53.750
Tomoe-san and Mio-san are over level 1,500.

05:53.750 --> 05:56.540
Yes. By the way, Mithra-senpai...

05:56.850 --> 05:59.750
Why do you look so troubled?

06:00.220 --> 06:07.000
Tomoe-san said she'd train with 
me after the academy festival.

06:07.000 --> 06:07.910
Seriously?

06:08.430 --> 06:12.000
She told me not to die 
with a straight face.

06:13.150 --> 06:15.480
Again, she's level 1,500.

06:18.530 --> 06:19.810
It's time, everyone.

06:20.190 --> 06:23.690
Let's begin the battle for a spot in the final.

06:23.690 --> 06:25.190
Let's do this.

06:25.190 --> 06:26.510
I will win.

06:26.980 --> 06:29.490
I'll win the team battle, as well.

06:29.490 --> 06:31.320
You're not taking my spot.

06:31.320 --> 06:32.800
I've got a secret strategy.

06:33.170 --> 06:34.870
I've got a strategy of my own.

06:35.550 --> 06:38.140
I will participate in the final 
with Shiki-san in the audience.

06:42.510 --> 06:43.560
What is that?

06:45.150 --> 06:48.630
He's using some kind of magic 
to enhance his abilities.

06:49.000 --> 06:51.820
It's probably a side effect of that.

06:51.820 --> 06:54.090
He looks like he'd taste disgusting,

06:54.960 --> 06:58.060
like some kind of adulterated hyuman.

06:58.360 --> 07:01.550
Shiki, how were the students?

07:01.550 --> 07:03.590
They fought fiercely for 
the right to participate

07:03.590 --> 07:06.520
using the rock-paper-scissors 
game you taught them.

07:07.200 --> 07:10.460
Anyway, that student they'll be facing...

07:10.460 --> 07:11.480
You noticed?

07:11.480 --> 07:15.070
He's using some type of magical medicine.

07:15.480 --> 07:20.340
But I'm more interested 
in that amulet of his.

07:20.760 --> 07:25.730
It's disguised to seem like it 
increases his magic resistance.

07:25.730 --> 07:26.930
Disguised?

07:27.510 --> 07:29.410
That's certainly odd.

07:29.810 --> 07:33.190
In reality, I believe it absorbs something.

07:33.480 --> 07:35.640
I've got a bad feeling about this.

07:35.640 --> 07:39.340
Indeed. The entire city gives 
off a strange feeling.

07:39.900 --> 07:43.820
Give the students any 
weapons they might need.

07:44.320 --> 07:45.440
Understood.

07:46.140 --> 07:49.580
Let's go. Don't hold back against Ilumgand.

07:49.890 --> 07:51.240
We know.

07:51.240 --> 07:55.330
We finally get to test your temporary 
enhancement skill in a real battle.

07:55.600 --> 08:00.290
If you let your guard down, 
we'll steal your thunder.

08:02.250 --> 08:04.640
Why did I go with rock?

08:04.640 --> 08:07.510
I'd be in the final if you hadn't drawn.

08:07.510 --> 08:10.540
Who throws paper four times in a row?

08:10.540 --> 08:13.970
I didn't get to participate 
in a single team battle.

08:14.430 --> 08:15.720
I'll crush them.

08:16.410 --> 08:17.550
I'll crush them.

08:18.010 --> 08:20.010
I'll crush them!

08:20.400 --> 08:23.480
What are you getting so worked up about?

08:24.150 --> 08:25.930
It's too late for that.

08:26.400 --> 08:29.940
There's clearly something wrong with him, 
but the ref is pretending not to notice.

08:30.330 --> 08:31.560
Yuck.

08:32.280 --> 08:36.920
<i>Hidden behind the student's strange behavior</i>

08:36.920 --> 08:39.860
<i>was a truth unknown even to Misumi Makoto.</i>

08:48.460 --> 08:51.870
<i>There are two people I can't forget.</i>

09:01.000 --> 09:04.050
<i>One is Otonashi Hibiki.</i>

09:07.640 --> 09:11.990
I wish I could've left school to help you.

09:11.990 --> 09:15.450
Your studies and the connections 
you'll make there are important.

09:15.790 --> 09:20.660
Once you graduate and return to 
the kingdom, we'll fight together.

09:20.970 --> 09:22.180
Hibiki-san...

09:23.120 --> 09:27.610
I'd feel encouraged to have your help.

09:27.610 --> 09:32.500
As fellow warriors, 
I'll wait for the day you return.

09:35.090 --> 09:40.580
<i>As the hero of Limia, she gave 
shape to my dreams and ideals.</i>

09:42.720 --> 09:44.740
<i>And the other is...</i>

09:45.690 --> 09:46.780
Luria?

09:50.010 --> 09:51.780
Is that you, Luria Aensland?

09:52.690 --> 09:54.640
Who are you?

09:54.970 --> 09:58.690
It's me, Ilumgand. 
Of the Hopleys family of Limia.

09:59.190 --> 10:01.410
We used to play together in Kaleneon.

10:02.640 --> 10:06.210
I remember the flowering fields of Agarest.

10:06.210 --> 10:11.120
Ilum-san, we learned about 
Kaleneon in our recent lecture.

10:11.620 --> 10:14.190
It fell at the start of the major invasion.

10:14.570 --> 10:16.060
Yeah.

10:16.670 --> 10:21.640
She's the daughter of the Aenslands, 
a noble family that prospered in Kaleneon.

10:21.640 --> 10:24.590
But weren't they destroyed by demons?

10:24.590 --> 10:26.600
All the nobles of Kaleneon were killed.

10:26.910 --> 10:27.840
Hey, cut it out.

10:28.510 --> 10:29.800
Sorry.

10:30.320 --> 10:32.440
She's Luria.

10:32.970 --> 10:37.350
You used to wear that same choker.

10:38.300 --> 10:39.270
Yes.

10:40.600 --> 10:42.730
It's true. I am Luria.

10:43.270 --> 10:47.740
You probably met me once, as well.

10:48.570 --> 10:51.710
You're a noble. 
What are you doing in this city?

10:52.440 --> 10:55.710
I was young, so I don't remember clearly,

10:56.200 --> 10:58.810
but apparently my parents 
sent me to safety.

11:03.170 --> 11:06.700
<i>She was alive. That was enough for me.</i>

11:08.090 --> 11:10.870
<i>But I couldn't suppress the rage-like 
emotion I felt at the thought</i>

11:10.870 --> 11:13.640
<i>that she might've forgotten the oath 
we made in the flowering fields.</i>

11:13.640 --> 11:16.490
You abandoned your people and lands to flee?

11:16.490 --> 11:19.900
Nobles should engage the enemy.

11:20.350 --> 11:23.650
Are you so desperate to live 
that you'd become a waitress?

11:23.650 --> 11:24.870
You should be ashamed.

11:24.870 --> 11:27.790
Yeah. You're an embarrassment 
to hyumankind.

11:28.690 --> 11:30.880
Both the Aensland family and you yourself.

11:30.880 --> 11:34.400
How dare you abandon your noble 
responsibility for your own survival?

11:35.660 --> 11:39.350
You've never truly faced death before.

11:40.450 --> 11:43.800
You have no idea how I've lived.

11:44.500 --> 11:46.770
You've no right to speak to me like that.

11:48.220 --> 11:53.100
What was that? 
You dare insult us, you coward?!

11:53.100 --> 11:57.560
We wouldn't cling to life and 
flee from battle like you did!

11:58.530 --> 12:04.520
Those who arrogantly make such bold claims 
are only capable of bullying the weak.

12:05.560 --> 12:10.750
You couldn't possibly risk your lives in war.

12:13.030 --> 12:14.700
No, I just—

12:15.080 --> 12:16.710
I'm in a hurry.

12:17.130 --> 12:18.340
Excuse me.

12:21.410 --> 12:23.390
Wait! Listen to me!

12:23.390 --> 12:24.640
Don't be rude!

12:26.130 --> 12:28.460
<i>That's enough.</i>

12:32.420 --> 12:36.130
<i>I don't even want to recall 
what happened next.</i>

12:37.230 --> 12:40.990
<i>I should've gone to see Luria again, but...</i>

12:41.560 --> 12:45.120
<i>Why does he have to keep getting in my way?</i>

12:48.080 --> 12:50.250
You're Ilumgand-sama, aren't you?

12:50.930 --> 12:54.670
Don't worry. I'm a student at the academy.

12:54.670 --> 12:57.790
There's something I'd like 
to discuss with you.

12:59.930 --> 13:03.420
This is a magical medicine being 
developed at the academy.

13:03.420 --> 13:07.590
It dramatically improves your 
physical and magical abilities.

13:07.970 --> 13:10.050
Would you like to try it?

13:10.690 --> 13:18.320
<i>I wanted power so I could defeat 
Kuzunoha and see Luria again, but...</i>

13:18.680 --> 13:19.890
Ilum-san!

13:19.890 --> 13:20.950
Are you all right?

13:20.950 --> 13:23.640
You seem unwell of late.

13:24.290 --> 13:26.400
I'm fine. It's nothing.

13:27.920 --> 13:31.690
<i>I need more. Don't you have 
a more effective medicine?</i>

13:31.690 --> 13:36.370
<i>I could get you some, 
but there are some side effects.</i>

13:36.970 --> 13:37.990
<i>I don't care what it is.</i>

13:38.460 --> 13:39.980
<i>Bring it to me right away.</i>

13:40.430 --> 13:41.940
<i>Very well.</i>

13:41.940 --> 13:45.610
<i>I'll also give you this amulet 
that increases magic resistance.</i>

13:45.610 --> 13:47.960
<i>It's a gift from me.</i>

13:49.080 --> 13:51.700
<i>That's not enough to earn my gratitude.</i>

13:51.700 --> 13:53.360
<i>Of course it isn't.</i>

13:53.360 --> 13:56.500
<i>I shall continue to provide 
all the assistance I can.</i>

13:56.500 --> 13:58.270
<i>I humbly beg your pardon.</i>

14:05.400 --> 14:07.610
<i>I had no idea what was happening.</i>

14:08.010 --> 14:11.940
<i>I didn't realize I was being used or that 
there was something wrong with my body.</i>

14:22.000 --> 14:23.170
Izumo, Yuno!

14:23.450 --> 14:24.540
Got it!

14:26.820 --> 14:29.200
They've increased their speed 
through physical enhancement.

14:29.200 --> 14:32.270
Those two will handle the six nobodies.

14:32.270 --> 14:33.860
Th-They're coming!

14:35.140 --> 14:36.780
Prepare yourself.

14:36.780 --> 14:39.010
I'll crush you!

14:40.470 --> 14:41.480
<i>So heavy!</i>

14:49.160 --> 14:53.070
Damn. You've embarrassed 
me in front of our teacher.

14:53.070 --> 14:55.780
Sorry, Izumo and Yuno.

14:56.730 --> 14:58.250
I'm starting without you.

14:58.250 --> 15:01.160
You nuisance. I'll crush you!

15:01.790 --> 15:05.550
Kuzunoha!

15:05.550 --> 15:06.830
Take this!

15:08.890 --> 15:10.630
Bull's-eye!

15:10.630 --> 15:12.270
Satania, bind them!

15:15.380 --> 15:16.760
One!

15:18.720 --> 15:20.270
Two!

15:21.740 --> 15:23.300
Three!

15:23.300 --> 15:24.570
And then...

15:26.680 --> 15:28.320
Four!

15:30.520 --> 15:33.620
Got my spear back, too.

15:34.900 --> 15:37.240
Looks like I win, Izumo-kun.

15:37.240 --> 15:39.070
You beat me.

15:40.100 --> 15:44.320
The short incantation reduces 
the power of the wind blade.

15:45.640 --> 15:47.730
That just leaves...

15:50.080 --> 15:52.210
Jin, you were supposed to wait!

15:52.210 --> 15:54.670
We promised we'd fight him together!

15:55.020 --> 15:58.480
You've gotten pretty tough, Ilumgand-senpai.

15:58.480 --> 16:00.720
But don't give up yet!

16:07.650 --> 16:11.400
Aw, shucks. There won't be 
anything left for us to do.

16:11.400 --> 16:13.190
Wait! His dolls...

16:13.620 --> 16:15.660
They're hardly damaged! What's going on?

16:16.070 --> 16:19.030
Jin's mixing in attacks 
that should knock him out.

16:27.360 --> 16:28.500
Seriously?

16:28.500 --> 16:29.810
That student...

16:29.810 --> 16:31.460
There's something wrong with him.

16:32.270 --> 16:33.930
If not...

16:33.930 --> 16:36.380
If not for him...

16:36.380 --> 16:40.880
Ref, are we good to keep fighting? 
He's acting weird.

16:40.880 --> 16:43.860
H-He seems to want to continue the match.

16:44.280 --> 16:46.160
His dolls are hardly damaged.

16:46.850 --> 16:48.050
Continue.

16:48.900 --> 16:55.030
I-I was supposed to achieve 
my ideals with the hero.

16:55.030 --> 16:58.280
Kuzunoha! Stay out of my way, Kuzunoha!

16:58.510 --> 17:01.040
That's not my problem. I'm not my teacher.

17:01.540 --> 17:04.620
And the ideals of someone 
who'd fight dirty in a match...

17:07.640 --> 17:09.250
aren't worth hearing!

17:11.050 --> 17:13.060
Izumo, Yuno! With me!

17:13.380 --> 17:14.810
Let's wrap this up!

17:20.140 --> 17:23.600
You've lost your mind!

17:23.850 --> 17:25.350
Yuno, I'm counting on you!

17:25.350 --> 17:26.440
Got it!

17:26.750 --> 17:27.520
Aeriel!

17:28.600 --> 17:29.930
You've got 20 seconds!

17:29.930 --> 17:34.580
I know! Here I come!

17:37.560 --> 17:40.210
<i>A jump kick and aerial combo.</i>

17:40.610 --> 17:41.660
<i>Though I'm far from home,</i>

17:41.660 --> 17:42.880
<i>something about that move seems</i>

17:42.880 --> 17:44.160
<i>vaguely Japanese.</i>

17:44.410 --> 17:48.820
Since you love weapons enough to eat them,

17:48.820 --> 17:51.120
here's a gift for you!

17:53.150 --> 17:54.250
Got him.

17:55.190 --> 17:56.440
Crap! She's falling!

17:56.710 --> 17:57.510
Yuno!

18:02.680 --> 18:07.640
Don't worry. Even I can use 
a bit of floating magic.

18:07.640 --> 18:09.260
Oh, yeah?

18:09.260 --> 18:10.960
You could've said so sooner.

18:12.620 --> 18:15.550
Either way, that was a terrifying attack.

18:15.550 --> 18:18.580
He can't defend properly in the air.

18:18.580 --> 18:21.440
I figured it'd be effective against 
someone who hadn't seen it before.

18:21.440 --> 18:25.040
Our current goal is to pull 
that off against Zwei-san.

18:29.740 --> 18:32.370
Th-The match is over!

18:38.340 --> 18:43.510
The girl who finished him off 
has some impressive moves.

18:43.510 --> 18:47.430
Indeed. That mid-air flurry 
of blows was something else.

18:47.430 --> 18:49.810
Perhaps I'll try it, as well.

18:50.930 --> 18:53.620
I'm glad I got to see their match.

18:53.620 --> 18:56.290
I was worried about the magical medicine.

18:56.550 --> 18:59.190
I'm going to go honor the winners.

18:59.190 --> 19:01.840
I want to check on Ilumgand, too.

19:02.840 --> 19:04.690
Young Master, look.

19:09.150 --> 19:10.630
<i>They're on alert?</i>

19:11.230 --> 19:12.250
<i>What's going on?</i>

19:12.950 --> 19:18.230
It's releasing some rather nasty waves.

19:18.230 --> 19:20.560
This alien mana...

19:21.030 --> 19:26.760
It's binding to the old 
emotions in his memories.

19:29.430 --> 19:32.790
Young Master, it's too late for him.

19:32.790 --> 19:33.600
Huh?

19:34.220 --> 19:36.590
He's no longer hyuman.

19:36.590 --> 19:39.000
He's begun to mutate.

19:39.000 --> 19:42.110
Mutate? Who would do that, 
and for what purpose?

19:42.550 --> 19:45.590
There's only one who would do that.

19:46.720 --> 19:48.530
You know who I mean, don't you?

19:49.440 --> 19:52.990
That can't be.

19:54.030 --> 19:56.960
But Rona-san complied with my request.

19:56.960 --> 20:00.330
She said she studied with 
Jin and the others, too.

20:00.840 --> 20:06.630
Young Master, did she say she 
wouldn't do anything in Rotsgard?

20:06.630 --> 20:07.880
Well...

20:08.390 --> 20:13.850
Then even if this were her doing, 
she wouldn't be breaking her promise.

20:14.370 --> 20:16.940
At the very least, that's what she'll say.

20:16.940 --> 20:19.270
That's just how demons operate.

20:20.620 --> 20:25.150
<i>Was I wrong to think I could 
associate with demons?</i>

20:26.000 --> 20:28.650
These demons aren't easy 
to get along with, either.

20:29.150 --> 20:34.770
Everyone's always trying to use 
or deceive the young master.

20:35.520 --> 20:37.250
They'll pay for this.

20:37.900 --> 20:40.360
<i>Given the circumstances, 
is it even possible?</i>

20:44.820 --> 20:47.460
<i>Would you like to retake your homeland?</i>

20:48.150 --> 20:53.510
<i>I wanted to restore Kaleneon and 
hide everything related to myself</i>

20:53.510 --> 20:56.070
<i>and the Kuzunoha Trading 
Company there, but...</i>

20:57.150 --> 20:58.150
<i>Damn.</i>

20:58.860 --> 21:01.100
<i>Damn, damn, damn.</i>

21:01.970 --> 21:04.080
So far, so good.

21:04.740 --> 21:09.980
I wasn't expecting to catch both the 
King of Limia and Princess Lily in this.

21:10.840 --> 21:17.610
Kuzunoha, if you're interested in demons, 
